              "value": "{{orderful-api-key}}",
              "placement": "header"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Fails the specified Delivery. This link is included when a Transaction is retrieved from a <a href=\"https://docs.orderful.com/reference/pollingcontroller_list\" target=\"_blank\">Poller Bucket</a> or via an <a href=\"https://docs.orderful.com/docs/inbound-http\" target=\"_blank\">Inbound HTTP Communication Channel</a>. \n\nIf this Delivery is the most recent one associated with a Transaction, this will update the Transaction's `deliveryStatus` to `FAILED`.\n\nIf this Delivery is associated with one or more"
        }
      ]
    }
